\newlabel{fig:flops}{{6}{7}{Inference FLOPs breakdown. TC-ViTok delivers a $3.39\times $ end-to-end speedup. The added encoder/TPN/merge overhead (blue, $\approx $3.2~GFLOPs) is invisible at this scale —- the LLM prefill dominates by $\geq $700{$\times $}}{figure.6}{}}
