\newlabel{fig:bars}{{8}{9}{Benchmark comparison across all models. TC-ViTok Final (red) and Adaptive (orange) both \emph {exceed} full LLaVA-1.5 on GQA (61.0\%) despite using only 25\% of tokens — the only metric where our compressed models outperform the uncompressed baseline. v3 GQA and POPE are estimated ($\dagger $)}{figure.8}{}}
